@artifact text/rust crates/reference-demo/src/main.rs
> Gate: Choose the presentation host and graphics API only after the renderer boundary and reference evidence are reviewed.
> Ruling: Reverse playback and arbitrary scrubbing are legal; playback need not be monotonic.
> Ruling: Beyond the journal horizon, indexed temporal definitions answer without invented authoritative events.
> Gate: Decide whether looping or bounds are product-level controls; neither is implicit engine behavior.
